 "もとめる": "أَرَادَ, رَغِبَ (To desire (to experience desire); to wish.)  [to want]\nمثال: 私たちは平和を求めている。\n→ We are longing for peace. / طَلَبَ (to express the need or desire for) / طَلَب, مَسْأَلَة (Act of requesting (with the adposition at in the presence of possessives, and on)  [to request]\nمثال: 彼は私に助けを求めてきた。\n→ He asked me for help. / بَحَثَ, طَلَبَ (To try to find; to look for; to search for.)  [to seek]\nمثال: 彼は職を求めて東京へやって来た。\n→ He came to Tokyo in search of employment. / شِرَاء, اِشْتِرَاء (The acquisition of title to, or property in, anything for a price; buying for mo) / مُشْتَرًى, مُشْتَرَيَات (That which is obtained for a price in money or its equivalent.) / اِشْتَرَى (To buy, obtain by payment of a price in money or its equivalent.)  [to purchase]",
