 "もともと": "أَصْلًا (As it was in the beginning; at first.)  [originally]\nمثال: 彼らは元々あった文明を破壊した。\n→ They destroyed the native civilization. / مُسَطَّح, مُنبَسِط (Flat and level.) / أَمْلَس, سَوِيّ (Without great variation.) / زَوْجِيّ (Of an integer, divisible by two.) / حَتَّى (In reality (used to imply an extreme example in the case mentioned).)  [(coming out) even]\nusu. as 〜て(も)もともと, 〜でもともと, etc.",
 "もとより": "أَصْلًا (As it was in the beginning; at first.)  [originally]\nمثال: もとより私は最悪の事態を覚悟していた。\n→ From the outset I was prepared for the worst. / طَبْعًا (Naturally; as would be expected; for obvious reasons, obviously.)  [of course]\nمثال: もとよりそんなことは承知の上だ。\n→ Of course I am aware of that. / [not to mention ... ; not only ... but also ...]\nusu. as ...はもとより...も\nمثال: 低賃金、劣悪な労働条件、一方的な首切りなどの経済・労働問題はもとより、各種の人道的問題までも引き起こしている。\n→ Of course, they are suffering from terrible working conditions such as low wages and arbitrary layoffs, as well as from various forms of…",
 "もとネタ": "أَصْلِيّ (First in a series of copies or versions.)  [original (that was parodied or acted as an inspiration for something else, etc.)]",
 "もどかしい": "فَشَّلَ (To hinder or thwart.)  [frustrating]",
 "もどき": "كَـ (having some of the characteristics of (used to form adjectiv)  [-like]\nafter a noun / تَقْلِيد (The act of imitating.)  [imitation] / [comical character who mocks or apes the main character (in Japanese performing arts)] / نَقْد, اِنْتِقَاد (The act of criticising; a critical judgment passed or expressed.)  [criticism]",
 "もどく": "لَامَ, اِسْتَنْكَرَ (To criticize harshly.)  [to censure] / قَلَّدَ (To follow as a model or a pattern; to make a copy, counterpart or semblance of.)  [to imitate]",
 "もどし": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [returning]",
 "もどす": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [to return]\nمثال: その本を棚に戻しておきなさい。\n→ Put the book back on the shelf. / تَقَيَّأَ, قَاءَ (To regurgitate or eject the contents of the stomach through the mouth; puke.) / تَقَيُّؤ (The act of vomiting.)  [to vomit] / شُفِيَ, بَرِئَ (To get better, to regain health or prosperity.)  [to recover (of a market price)]",
 "もどってくる": "عَادَ, رَجَعَ (To return to a place.)  [to come back]\nمثال: すぐ戻ってきます。\n→ I'll be back in a few minutes.",
 "もどって来る": "عَادَ, رَجَعَ (To return to a place.)  [to come back]\nمثال: すぐ戻ってきます。\n→ I'll be back in a few minutes.",
 "もどり": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [return] / رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [return (from a procedure)]",
 "もどる": "[to turn back (e.g. half-way)] / رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [to return]\nمثال: やってしまったことは元に戻らない。\n→ What is done cannot be undone. / شُفِيَ, بَرِئَ (To get better, to regain health or prosperity.)  [to recover (e.g. something lost)] / [to rebound ; to spring back]",
 "もどろ": "بُقْعَة (A round or irregular patch on the surface of a thing having a different color, t)  [spots]\nمثال: 赤白まだらのタオルを一本ください。\n→ A red and spotted white towel, please.",
 "もなかのつき": "بَدْر (phase of moon when in opposition to sun) / بَدْر (the moon when in opposition to sun)  [full moon]",
 "もにょる": "تَرَدَّدَ (To stop or pause respecting decision or action; to be in suspense or uncertainty)  [to hesitate (to say)]",
 "もぬけのから": "خَالِيّ (Not occupied; empty.) / خَاوِي, فَارِغ (Showing no intelligence or interest.)  [vacant] / جُثَّة, جُثْمَان (A dead body, especially that of a human as opposed to an animal.)  [corpse] / [shed skin (of a snake, insect, etc.)]\norig. meaning",
 "もぬけのカラ": "خَالِيّ (Not occupied; empty.) / خَاوِي, فَارِغ (Showing no intelligence or interest.)  [vacant] / جُثَّة, جُثْمَان (A dead body, especially that of a human as opposed to an animal.)  [corpse] / [shed skin (of a snake, insect, etc.)]\norig. meaning",
