 "ものおもわしい": "مُفَكِّر, مُتَأَمِّل (Having the appearance of deep, often melancholic, thinking.)  [pensive]",
 "ものか": "كَأَنَّ, كَأَنَّمَا (As though; in a manner suggesting.)  [as if (something untrue was actually true)]\nمثال: ムーリエルが貼ったリンクはもう二度とクリックするもんか。\n→ I shall never follow links posted by Muiriel again.",
