 "ものがたる": "أَخْبَرَ, قَالَ (Social senses of communicating) / تَلّ (A hill or mound, originally and especially in the Middle East, over or consistin)  [to tell (a story)]\nمثال: この話はアメリカに起こっていることについて多くを物語っている。\n→ This story says a lot about what has happened to America. / ثَبَتَ, وَضَحَ (To display, convey or exhibit; to have something available for others to see; to) / عَرْض, اِسْتِعْرَاض (A play, dance, or other entertainment.) / بَرْنَامَج (A broadcast program, especially a light entertainment program.) / مَعْرِض (An agricultural exhibition.) / إِظْهَار, عَرْض (A demonstration.)  [to show]\nمثال: 子供が健康だということは母親の育て方が立派であるということを物語る。\n→ The child's good health says a great deal for maternal care.",
