 "ものすごい": "تَرَنُّح (An unsteady movement of the body in walking or standing as if one were about to ) / تَرَنَّحَ (To sway unsteadily, reel, or totter.)  [staggering]\nمثال: 彼女はものすごい食欲がある。\n→ She has a gigantic appetite. / فَظِيع (Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome) / مُرْعِب (Formidable, powerful.) / مُرْعِب (Intense; extreme in degree or extent.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very unpleasant; disagreeable.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very bad; lousy.)  [terrible]\nمثال: ものすごい叫び声に彼はぞっとした。\n→ The sound of an awful scream made him shudder.",
