 "ものとり": "لِصّ, لِصَّة (One who carries out a theft.)  [thief]\nمثال: 物取りなので、物を盗ったら帰ります。通報したら刺します。\n→ I'm a thief, I'll go back when I've taken the stuff. Report me and I'll stab you.",
 "ものども": "مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you] / نَاس, خَلْق (plural of person: a body of persons considered generally or collectively; a grou) / خَلْق, شَعْب (Persons forming or belonging to a particular group, such as a nation, class, eth) / أَهْل (A person's ancestors, relatives or family.) / شَعْب (The mass of a community as distinguished from a special class (elite); the commo)  [people]",
 "ものにする": "اِسْتَقْبَلَ (To receive.) / أَصْبَحَ (To become, or cause oneself to become (often with temporary states, past partici)  [to get]\nمثال: どんなに勉強したって、１年や２年で外国語をものにすることはできない。\n→ However hard one may work, one cannot master a foreign language in a year or two. / تَعَلَّمَ (To acquire, or attempt to acquire knowledge or an ability to do something.) / تَعَلَّمَ (To attend a course or other educational activity.) / اِعْتَبَرَ, اِتَّعَظَ (To gain knowledge from a bad experience so as to improve.)  [to learn] / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [to complete]",
 "ものの": "رَغْم أَنَّ, مَعَ أَنَّ (Though, even though, in spite of or despite the fact that: introducing a clause )  [although]\nمثال: パーティーに行くことにしたものの、気が進まない。\n→ Though I have decided to go to the party, I'm not looking forward to it.",
