 "よやく": "حَجْز (An arrangement by which accommodation or transport arrangements are secured in a)  [reservation]\nمثال: 「ホテルの予約はしてありますか」「すみませんが、まだなんです」\n→ \"Have you reserved a hotel room?\" \"Sorry, not yet.\" / عَقْد, مُعَاهَدَة (An agreement which the law will enforce in some way. A legally binding contract ) / أَغْدَمَ, اِدَّغَمَ (To shorten by omitting a letter or letters or by reducing two or more vowels or )  [contract]\nمثال: あなたの定期購読予約は六月号で切れます。\n→ Your subscription expires with the June issue. / بَرْمَجَة (The act of writing a computer program.)  [programming (e.g. a device)]",
 "よやくうけつけ": "حَجْز (An arrangement by which accommodation or transport arrangements are secured in a)  [reservation]",
