 "よりどころ": "أَرْض (The surface of the Earth, as opposed to the sky or water or underground.) / أَرْض (Soil, earth.) / مَلْعَب كُرَة قَدَم (A soccer stadium.)  [grounds]\nمثال: 「広辞苑にこう書いてあります」と言って、広辞苑を唯一の拠り所に論陣を張る人がよくいる。\n→ There are a lot of people who say, \"it says this in Koujien,\" and use that dictionary as the only grounds for their argument. / دَعَمَ, دَعَّمَ (To help keep from falling.) / أَيَّدَ, دَعَمَ (To back or favor a cause, party, etc., mentally or with concrete aid) / تَأْيِيد, دَعْم (Financial or other help.)  [support]",
 "よりぬき": "نُخْبَة (A special group or social class of people who have a superior social or economic)  [elite]\nمثال: あの科学者たちは選り抜きだ。\n→ Those scientists are the cream of the crop.",
