 "よる": "[to be due to ; to be caused by]\nesp. 依る, 拠る\nمثال: 造られたもので、この方によらずできたものは一つもない。\n→ Without him nothing was made that has been made. / شَغَّلَ (To power up, to put into operation, to start, to activate (an appliance, light, ) / اِنْقَلَبَ عَلَى (To rebel against; to suddenly attack.)  [to turn on]\nesp. 依る\nمثال: この理由により、著者に関する信憑性は、資料の信憑性に拠っているのである。\n→ For this reason, the credibility of the book's authors rests on the credibility of their sources. / [to be based on ; to come from]\nesp. 因る, 由る / [to be based at (a location, an organization) ; to be headquartered at]\nesp. 拠る",
 "よるがた": "لَيْلِيّ (Of an occurrence, taking place at night, nightly.)  [nocturnal (person)]\nمثال: 僕は夜型なんだ。\n→ I'm a night owl.",
