 "よれよれ": "بَالٍ (Damaged due to continued or hard exposure or use until no longer effective or us)  [worn-out]\nمثال: 彼は小型トラックとよれよれの大きな芝刈り機をもっていた。\n→ He had an old pickup truck and a big, battered mower. / [completely exhausted]",
