 "よろう": "[to put on armour (armor) ; to wear armour] / لَبِسَ (to have on (clothes or accessories)) / اِرْتَدَى (to have on (clothes or accessories)) / اِهْتِراء (Damage to the appearance and/or strength of an item caused by use over time.)  [to wear]",
