 "よろず": "عَشَرَة آلَاف (The cardinal number 10,000.)  [ten thousand]\n萬 is sometimes used in legal documents\nمثال: ４０万ガロンの石油がパイプラインから溢れ出た。\n→ 400,000 gallons of oil have spilled out of the pipeline. / [myriad] / كُلّ شَيْء (All the things under discussion.)  [everything] / مُخْتَلِف, مُتَنَوَّع (Having a broad range (of different elements).)  [various]",
