 "わき": "إِبْط (The cavity beneath the junction of the arm and shoulder.)  [armpit] / بِالْقُرْب مِن, بِجَانِب (Near.)  [close to]\nalso written as 傍, 側\nمثال: 彼がブリーフケースを脇に抱えてやってくるのが見えた。\n→ I saw him coming with his briefcase under his arm. / بَعِيدًا (From a place, hence.)  [away] / خارج الـموضوع (Not related to the matter under discussion.)  [off-topic]",
