 "わきあがる": "هَاجَ, غَلَى (Of a liquid, vapor, etc., or a container holding it: to foam or froth in an agit)  [to seethe]\nesp. 沸き上がる / نَهَضَ (To spring up; to come into action, being, or notice; to become operative, sensib)  [to arise]\nمثال: 彼は胸中に愛国心が湧き上がるのを感じた。\n→ He felt patriotism rise in his breast. / [to get excited ; to be in uproar]",
