 "わずか": "قَلِيلًا (To a small extent or degree.)  [a little]\nمثال: わずかな誤りでも致命的な惨事につながるかもしれない。\n→ The slightest mistake may lead to a fatal disaster. / وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only]\nمثال: 私はわずか１０００円しか持っていない。\n→ I have no more than 1,000 yen with me.",
 "わずかに": "قَلِيلًا (To a small extent or degree.)  [slightly] / بِٱلْكَاد (By a small margin.)  [barely]\nمثال: 霧を通して、わずかに陸地をみわけることができた。\n→ The land could just be discerned through the mist. / وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only]\nمثال: 彼はわずかに１００冊の本しか持っていない。\n→ He has no more than one hundred books.",
 "わずらい": "قَلِقَ (To be troubled; to give way to mental anxiety or doubt.) / قَلَق (A strong feeling of anxiety.)  [worry]\nesp. 煩い / مَرَض, دَاء (An instance (episode) of a disease or poor health.)  [illness]\nesp. 患い\nمثال: 長いわずらいで彼は借金をこさえた。\n→ His long sickness ran him into debt.",
