 "わずらう": "قَلِقَ (To be troubled; to give way to mental anxiety or doubt.) / قَلَق (A strong feeling of anxiety.)  [to worry (about)]\nمثال: いくつか聞きたい事があるが今はあなたを煩わせたくはない。\n→ I have some questions to ask, but I don't want to bother you now. / [to have trouble doing ... ; to struggle to ...]\nafter the -masu stem of a verb",
 "わずらわしい": "مُزْعِج (Causing irritation or annoyance; troublesome; vexatious.)  [annoying]\nمثال: あ、とりあえず包帯しているけど、もし煩わしかったら、家に帰ってからカットバンに代えても大丈夫よ。\n→ Ah, well I've bandaged it for the meantime but if that's awkward then it's fine to replace it with a plaster when you get home.",
