 "わんりょく": "[strength in one's arms ; physical strength]\nمثال: 父は昔腕力のある人でした。\n→ My father used to be a strong man. / قُوَّة (Ability to influence; strength or energy of body or mind; active power; vigour; ) / قُوَّة (Anything that is able to make a substantial change in a person or thing.) / أَجْبَرَ, اِضْطَرَّ (To compel (an adversary or partner) to trump a trick by leading a suit that he/s)  [force]\nمثال: 君は腕力に訴えてはならない。\n→ You must never resort to force.",
