 "んちわー": "آلُو, آلُوْ (A greeting used when answering the telephone.) / هَل مِن أَحَدٍ هُنَا؟ (A call for response if it is not clear if anyone is present or listening, or if )  [hello]",
 "んで": "لِأَنَّ (By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that.) / هكذا, بلا سبب (Used alone to refuse to provide a full answer to a question begun with \"why\", us)  [because]\nなので after nouns or na-adjectives; more objective and slightly more formal than から\nمثال: とても暗いので私は本が読めない。\n→ It is too dark for me to read. / إِذَنْ, لِذٰلِكَ (Consequently, by or in consequence of that or this cause; referring to something)  [therefore]\nat sentence beginning; dated or colloquial",
