 "んん": "[hm ; um] / [huh? ; what?] / لَا (Not any.) / نَعَم (Used to show agreement with a negative question.) / لَا, لَاءَان (A negating expression; an answer that shows disagreement, denial, refusal, or di) / لَا (A vote not in favor, or opposing a proposition.)  [no]",
